                <invention-title lang="de">SYSTEME UND VERFAHREN ZUR DESINFEKTION VON EINRICHTUNGEN EINES VERGNÜGUNGSPARKS</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">SYSTÈMES ET PROCÉDÉS DE DÉSINFECTION D'ÉQUIPEMENT DE PARC D'ATTRACTIONS</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">SYSTEMS AND METHODS FOR SANITIZING AMUSEMENT PARK EQUIPMENT</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An amusement park ride sanitization system includes a ride path for an amusement ride vehicle, and a sanitization station comprising a housing disposed along the ride path configured to receive the amusement ride vehicle along the ride path, and a sanitization device disposed within the housing and configured to sanitize the amusement ride vehicle.</p>
